  "projectUrl": "https://github.com/AJ-comp/Compiler",
  "published": "2026-07-18T23:46:31.91Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Render parse-tree and AST debug dumps (ParseTreeSymbol.ToTreeString / AstSymbol.ToTreeString) by threading a single shared StringBuilder through the recursion instead of accumulating per-node substrings, cutting the render from O(n^2) to O(n) on deeply nested trees; the emitted text is byte-for-byte unchanged. Parsing, tokenizing, and every other engine path are unaffected.",
